mechanism:
The four standalone patterns
  def : Pat<(int_nvvm_ff2f16x2_rn f32:$a, f32:$b),      (CVT_f16x2_f32 $a, $b, CvtRN)>;
  def : Pat<(int_nvvm_ff2f16x2_rn_relu ...), (CVT_f16x2_f32 ... CvtRN_RELU)>;
